<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in June 18 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in June 18 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JUNE 18</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............821,200 up.....2,800</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......721,600 down...5,700</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......569,500 up.....6,100</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....874,428 ..up..14,633</p>
<p> Financial companies.......671,547...up...5,680</p>
<p> New York business loans....46,514 down.....107</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......46,248 down.....113</p>
</text>
